{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"60a014e419b8f411bfd1f65477942f5f925db5e17a5b114f80ed313b53177d8f","ja":"福笑いの見本","zh":"福笑拼图的范本","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7d1d9d2c2fea2bbb6f809a736ca01fedc2dbd10d787012886d38a2586af55398","ja":"この福笑いはオリジナリティにあふれています！\nパーツを固定して、劇場に飾りたいくらいです！","zh":"这个福笑游戏充满了独创性！\n甚至让人想把五官固定住，装饰在剧场里呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6ab1a58557cd71e24f46321c8b323260cdc6947d7e407c01be6403e749fb10de","ja":"ロコは福笑いにインフィニティの可能性を感じました！\nいっぱい作って、みんなにも挑戦してもらいたいです！","zh":"ROCO感受到了福笑游戏中蕴含的无限可能性！\n想做很多很多出来，让大家也来挑战一下！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"d64056e51ba7df8a7ac09411513959e499972529c3e0a70652f02a1204c03953","ja":"おお～っきな福笑いがたくさん……。\nなんだか、すごいですね！","zh":"好～大的福笑脸有好多副……\n总觉得好壮观呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"032739aca3ce0f03280a245ea89cdc34c5429d11dc896f794e7f95164bf17c36","ja":"はい！　そうと決まったら、こうしてはいられません！\nロコはこれで！","zh":"好的！既然决定了，那就刻不容缓了！\nROCO就先告辞了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"7567e9ee9b0b572710d0a4205dd0d32afd31b4422847b52a37a5101f79a660cd","ja":"えっ？　この福笑いはどうしたら……\nロコちゃん！？　待って～っ！","zh":"诶？　这个福笑游戏该怎么……\nROCO！？　等等我～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"7766cb47240702eb6f45535130a2ec479d3aa6379473e5eb32a9961275275a24","ja":"ソーリーです……ロコとしたことが\nアートを置き去りにしてしまって……。","zh":"抱歉……ROCO一时大意，\n竟然把艺术抛在脑后了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"46695b66097826772827d1ea516647629a8c1810a4e5fccdd3913b701be58739","ja":"うん……けどロコちゃんがパーツを崩したくないなら、\n練習はここでストップかな？","zh":"嗯……不过要是小ROCO不想弄乱零件的话，\n练习就先到此为止吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"e1dbd8559947442b7be2bb6a1ea2827e0e8cc38f33b64d2c3065f991649616a3","ja":"そうですね。本番はきっと見本がありますし、\nそれに近くなるように頑張れば、大丈夫かなーって！","zh":"是啊。正式开始时肯定会有样品参考，\n只要努力做得接近一点，应该就没问题了吧——我是这么觉得的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"e13d549a5721af7982aa58e4c320f3fcb630fd9f5e0ad8f1dce5fd4badabf087","ja":"そっか……今回も、見本があれば、\nこんなに悩まないで、できたかもしれないね。","zh":"这样啊……要是这次也有范本的话，\n或许就不用这么苦恼，直接做出来了吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3fd29dd647551c2d91e7d00ed39d2b30970ea78148fff31416d63257c139ea31","ja":"●●●●プロデューサーが、\nそばにいてくれたら……。","zh":"要是●●●●制作人\n能陪在我身边的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"e0ad9ad020f6df9025d54b6368487f83f76f4daa57950294fb08ccaafbe05866","ja":"……ガチャッ","zh":"……咔哒","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"68a149d8fef56699382b00fd45efe5d6bf9a710f199976ab28e06e648d791d3a","ja":"えっ……●●●●プロデューサー！？　あっ、えっと\n……そばにいてくれたら、というのは、その……！","zh":"欸……●●●●制作人！？　啊，那个\n……如果能陪在我身边，是指，那个……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"a8ea8eab898ee7ee34afcac265a5d62c04a6d78b579572baf8868e656bf65131","ja":"●●●●プロデューサー、新しいアートが\n完成しました！　見てください♪","zh":"●●●●制作人，新的艺术创作\n已经完成啦！请过目吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"c3f00012c7fbbf0c7f981f7d4dce196fd54abdb8188e5308e0e8444c3f655130","ja":"私たち、今度の番組でやる\n福笑いの練習をしてたんですよ～！","zh":"我们刚才在练习下次节目里\n要玩的拼笑脸游戏呢～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1698.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"fb576c9c91603aaa0b66fa0cae8c8be07528e11d26d2eec5aaa4a7a46a742908","ja":"そ、そうなんです！　そばに、と言っても、その、\n練習のために、ということで、深い意味は……。","zh":"没、没错的！虽说是在身边，那个，\n也只是为了练习，并没有什么深意……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
